===== VERDICT: DATA_LIMITED =====
AU added at N=13: rho=+0.385 (Delta_rho=-0.056), p=0.1944 (Delta_p=+0.042). AU inclusion WEAKENS cross-market correlation. AU is an off-ladder LOW-theta_rel RESIDUAL: it sits at inst_pct~0.37 (mid-high) but theta_rel~0.15 (very low), inverting the developed-market ladder. Drop-AU LOO recovers K1172 rho=+0.441, confirming AU is a mild leverage point. Structural interpretation: ASX Top 10 is heavy on banks/miners where earnings reports generate less idiosyncratic volatility than in US/CA/BR. Gap NOT closed by AU.

